flowchart TD
    A[Open CoastDepth in Processing Toolbox] --> B{Private dependencies ready?}
    B -- No --> C[Show ERROR with missing names and copy pip commands for OSGeo4W Shell]
    C --> B
    B -- Yes --> D[Choose datasets and polygon or layer extent]
    D --> E[Snapshot selected features and transform ROI to EPSG:4326]
    E --> F{Valid bounded ROI?}
    F -- No --> D
    F -- Yes --> G{Credentials available?}
    G -- No --> H[Login dialog and optional encrypted QGIS storage]
    H --> I[Verify using official Toolbox]
    G -- Yes --> I
    I -- Invalid --> H
    I -- Valid --> J[Discover live dataset version and variable names]
    J --> K[Subset height and quality plus method when available]
    K --> L[Validate actual grid and source metadata]
    L --> M[Local polygon mask preserving holes and nodata]
    M --> N[NetCDF and or GeoTIFF with provenance and checksums]
    N --> O{All datasets succeeded?}
    O -- More datasets --> J
    O -- Yes --> P[Publish completed run folder atomically]
    P --> Q[Add results to QGIS and save safe JSONL log]
    K -. Transient service failure .-> R[Bounded retry and backoff]
    R --> K
    K -. Cancel or timeout .-> S[Stop worker and remove only run staging]
    L -. Failure .-> S
    S --> T[Safe failure log and manual Retry]
